+"Audit events are stored in a durable audit table.","README.md:8","minisvc/audit.py:4-10 only returns a dict, while minisvc/storage/repo.py:11-29 creates and uses only the orders table; runtime inspection found tables=['orders'] after create/read flows.","contradicted","Teams may assume an audit trail exists when no durable audit record is written."
